  <div>
    <h4>Air quality, pollen, UV</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Air quality (AQI) — PM10, PM2.5 and ultrafine particulates, 5-level Good→Hazardous scale and a nationwide map</li>
      <li>Pollen (Health Weather Index) — oak, pine and weed pollen risk (concentrated Apr–Jun)</li>
      <li>UV index forecast — hourly, 5-level Safe→Extreme scale</li>
      <li>Especially helpful with allergies, asthma or sensitive skin, or when heading out with kids or older family</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h4>Home screen widgets</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>4×1 — current temperature and condition with a small radar thumbnail</li>
      <li>4×2 — radar map plus an hourly forecast strip</li>
      <li>Location — current location or any registered favorite</li>
